			"notes": "# PF-EMI // Minecraft 26.3 Update\n\n### New Features\n\n- **Serverless Recipes:** Added support for displaying default Minecraft recipes when a server doesn't provide recipe data. Issue #6 \n- **Fallback Notification:** Players are notified when default recipes are being used instead of server-provided recipes.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- **Iron Jetpacks:** Fixed incorrect ingredients, crafting layouts, and item variants appearing in recipes.\n- **Modded Recipes:** Fixed recipes displaying incorrect items when multiple variants share the same base item.\n- **Recipe Synchronization:** Fixed fallback recipes interfering with server-provided recipes.\n- **Recipe Reloading:** Fixed issues with recipe data persisting incorrectly when switching worlds or servers.\n\n### Improvements\n\n- Improved compatibility with modded crafting recipes and custom item components.\n- Improved recipe loading and synchronization across Fabric, NeoForge, and Forge.\n\n**Supported Loaders:** Fabric, NeoForge, Forge. Java 25 required.\n\nReport Issues on GitHub: https://github.com/bostonstuddard/PF-EMI/issues"
		},
