			"notes": "# PF-EMI — Minecraft 26.2 Update\n\n### Improvements\n- Backported newer PF-EMI features and improvements from Minecraft 26.3.\n- Improved status effect displays and compatibility.\n- Improved recipe handling and mod compatibility across loaders.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed incorrect ingredients and crafting layouts for Iron Jetpacks recipes.\n- Improved handling of modded recipes with multiple variations.\n- Improved recipe synchronization between clients and servers.\n\n### New Features\n- Added a vanilla recipe fallback for servers that don't provide recipe data.\n- Added a notification when fallback recipes are being used.\n\n**Supported Loaders:** Fabric, NeoForge, Forge.\n\nReport Issues on GitHub: https://github.com/bostonstuddard/PF-EMI/issues"
		},
